  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Profile dialog: Bugfix selecting deleted Default profile",
  "description": "The Default profile is never deleted, just reset.  So when the Default profile is selected to be \"deleted\" but the user also still wants it as the current profile, the main application needs to force a reload of the Default profile by passing NULL to mainApp->setConfigurationProfile()\n\nAlso, remove the ProfileChanging signal being called from the ProfileDialog (and prevent it from being called elsewhere).  It is already handled in MainApplication::setConfigurationProfile as that is the central processor for when a configuration profile is set/changed.\n\nFixup 0a1e7ed9b8e23d33cd6b8c10b2acd82636585f89\nPing #21262 \n\nAI-Assisted: no",
